{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SpectatorNormalization","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SpectatorNormalization","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SpectatorNormalization","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SpectatorNormalization","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/SpectatorNormalization.lean#L31-L48","doc":"**Content statement** (from manuscript):\n\nThe **spectator normalization** captures the contribution of\nunchanged nucleons to the Q-value character sum.  In a beta\ndecay ${}^A_Z X \\to {}^A_{Z+1} Y + e^- + \\bar\\nu$, only one\nneutron converts to a proton; the remaining $Z$ protons and\n$N - 1$ neutrons are spectators.\n\n    The Lean encoding **names** the conditional conjecture as a `Prop`\n    (pattern C of the vacuity-fix playbook): the context class is the\n    carrier of the spectator-count data, and `SpectatorNormalization`\n    is the proposition that the spectator decomposition holds for that\n    data.  It is *not* asserted (no `theorem … := ⟨ctx.claim_*⟩`\n    self-assuming projection); an instance discharging it is the open\n    conditional claim. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:spectator-normalization","label":"def:spectator-normalization","md":"quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/spectator-normalization.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SpectatorNormalizationContext.spectator_n","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SpectatorNormalizationContext.spectator_n","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/SpectatorNormalization.lean#L29-L29","doc":"Number of spectator neutrons (always `N − 1` for `β⁻` decay). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SpectatorNormalizationContext.spectator_p","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SpectatorNormalizationContext.spectator_p","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/SpectatorNormalization.lean#L27-L27","doc":"Number of spectator protons (always `Z` for `β⁻` decay). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SpectatorNormalizationContext.converting","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SpectatorNormalizationContext.converting","kind":"def","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/SpectatorNormalization.lean#L25-L25","doc":"Number of converting nucleons (always `1` for `β⁻` decay). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SpectatorNormalizationContext.N","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SpectatorNormalizationContext.N","kind":"def","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/SpectatorNormalization.lean#L23-L23","doc":"Neutron number `N` of parent. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SpectatorNormalizationContext.Z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SpectatorNormalizationContext.Z","kind":"def","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/SpectatorNormalization.lean#L21-L21","doc":"Proton number `Z` of parent. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SpectatorNormalizationContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SpectatorNormalizationContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":19,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/SpectatorNormalization.lean#L19-L19","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.SpectatorNormalizationContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.SpectatorNormalizationContext","kind":"class","line":16,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/SpectatorNormalization.lean#L16-L29","doc":"Abstract context for the `SpectatorNormalization` claim —\nmanuscript-themed typed fields below; the spectator-count\nidentity for `β⁻`-decay is captured. ","signatureChunk":0}]}